🧩 Extended Description
NeuroLearn Adaptive Engine is a data‑driven learning optimization system that predicts student mastery levels and adapts instructional content in real time. It integrates probabilistic modeling, lightweight neural predictors, and rule‑based adaptation strategies to personalize difficulty, pacing, and exercise selection. By continuously analyzing accuracy, response time, and error patterns, the engine refines its learner model and selects the next optimal learning action. NeuroLearn provides a scalable foundation for intelligent tutoring systems, adaptive assessments, and AI‑driven curriculum design.

